{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the early content of KIN:D Barabin's Expedition. Come visit grandma's house and join the adventure with explorer Barabin, whom you meet by chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/5d77a12be0daea06a6d7e5c2fb4b01a5.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adventure with KIND</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KIND are beings that can speak and possess intelligence similar to humans. In the very distant past, they were depicted as divine entities, and later portrayed as monsters or spirits. Some KIND possess strength far greater than humans, while others can run on water. These mysterious beings are rarely seen in cities, but appear quite commonly in the countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/95b063917af473a5e05b5ab975084aaf.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visiting your grandmother's house in the countryside for your elementary school's founding day holiday, you get lost in a forest said to have a magical well, where you encounter KIND Barabin, an explorer who resembles a kidney bean. Explorer Barabin never leaves anyone in trouble behind. Your journey to return to grandmother's house begins with him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/f77c00e3f6f931ae5d343c6df629007e.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/33be9d3f85f4a9ac383d7961ec6e1fba.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/8b1ddcf0316fd6ccbc935df853b2ff28.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/3c57e922d95fc79b28a3d7b6c015eb5a.poster.avif?t=1754450107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/3c57e922d95fc79b28a3d7b6c015eb5a.webm?t=1754450107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/3c57e922d95fc79b28a3d7b6c015eb5a.mp4?t=1754450107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your adventure is filled with</strong> unexplained weather anomalies and strange events. Crossing frozen lakes covered in heavy snow, climbing over earthquake-struck mountains\u2014 what other events will unfold before you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/618a83054e6d7740fd65929bb7400042.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/305b8658109ba03ba253c63f3220deba.poster.avif?t=1754450107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/305b8658109ba03ba253c63f3220deba.webm?t=1754450107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/305b8658109ba03ba253c63f3220deba.mp4?t=1754450107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your adventure includes</strong> unique KIND companions, such as racers who run on water and young monks who shatter rocks with rhythm martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/a8cff714c11ddf0f2fc1e898bda726cd.poster.avif?t=1754450107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/a8cff714c11ddf0f2fc1e898bda726cd.webm?t=1754450107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/a8cff714c11ddf0f2fc1e898bda726cd.mp4?t=1754450107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With their special abilities, pushing heavy objects together, and the power of cooperation where each plays their role even when separated\u2014 you can overcome any trial!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/d1d3e1f99d51093ebf84aaf09527edb9.poster.avif?t=1754450107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/d1d3e1f99d51093ebf84aaf09527edb9.webm?t=1754450107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/d1d3e1f99d51093ebf84aaf09527edb9.mp4?t=1754450107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/09f18fd0fbe6fa0169179d7cecf7ca36.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your adventure features</strong> visuals inspired by 2000s handheld gaming graphics, music inspired by game music from that era, and environments and stories filled with such nostalgia. The methods of expression, gameplay, and storytelling all evoke nostalgia\u2014 let's journey together into the world of KIND that evokes nostalgia!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915410?t=1754450107","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915410?t=1754450107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/2247ff91dab5252205198216e70df1a4437967fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754450107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/2247ff91dab5252205198216e70df1a4437967fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754450107","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains the early content of KIN:D Barabin's Expedition. Come visit grandma's house and join the adventure with explorer Barabin, whom you meet by chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/5d77a12be0daea06a6d7e5c2fb4b01a5.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adventure with KIND</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KIND are beings that can speak and possess intelligence similar to humans. In the very distant past, they were depicted as divine entities, and later portrayed as monsters or spirits. Some KIND possess strength far greater than humans, while others can run on water. These mysterious beings are rarely seen in cities, but appear quite commonly in the countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/95b063917af473a5e05b5ab975084aaf.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visiting your grandmother's house in the countryside for your elementary school's founding day holiday, you get lost in a forest said to have a magical well, where you encounter KIND Barabin, an explorer who resembles a kidney bean. Explorer Barabin never leaves anyone in trouble behind. Your journey to return to grandmother's house begins with him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/f77c00e3f6f931ae5d343c6df629007e.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/33be9d3f85f4a9ac383d7961ec6e1fba.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/8b1ddcf0316fd6ccbc935df853b2ff28.avif?t=1754450107\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/extras/3c57e922d95fc79b28a3d7b6c015eb5a.poster.avif?t=1754450107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915410/ext